, it mostly works as expected.\r\n\r\nI noticed two issues that hamper usability:\r\n\r\n- After pausing, you can't resume by pressing <kbd>F7</kbd> while the game window (or embedded game) is focused. You need to click the editor's pause button or press <kbd>F7</kbd> while the editor is focused.\r\n- If you press <kbd>F7</kbd> again while the game is paused, attempting to unpause it in the editor will pause the game one frame later, likely because the in-game <kbd>F7</kbd> attempt is queued while the game is paused.\r\n  - This is printed when you attempt to pause a second time:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Got break when already broke!\r\n   at: debug (./core/debugger/remote_debugger.cpp:471)\r\n```","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103411#pullrequestreview-2655571972","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103411","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103411#pullrequestreview-2655571972"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103411"}},"submitted_at":"2025-03-03T23:27:11Z","commit_id":null}]